                             Business questions
Which stocks carry the highest investment risk?

                Query
SELECT
    name,
   	MAX(high - low) AS unstable_movement
	FROM stock_data
	GROUP  BY name
	ORDER BY unstable_movement DESC;


             Insight:
Stock with higher and unstable movement from the data risky investment options because their prices fluctuate more aggressively than others in the market.


        Recommendation:
The company should balance high risk stocks with more stable investments to reduce overall portfolio risk and maintain long term investment stability.
